# P5 U3b: a table's inline code across a live theme switch. fx keeps a table's
# cells as they were styled when the table was added (store.zig:3758@481104fd
# skips `.assistant_table`; renderTableForTranscript takes no theme,
# transcript_blocks.zig:980-984), so its inline code keeps the shade it was
# drawn in while the prose around it is recoloured. Dark first, then the
# terminal reports light and dark again (as p5-inline-code-retint).
gateway p5-inline-code-table-turns.json
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
wait 4
type show me the table
wait 1
key Enter
wait 8
snap dark
key -H 1b 5b 3f 39 39 37 3b 32 6e
wait 2
snap light
key -H 1b 5b 3f 39 39 37 3b 31 6e
wait 2
snap dark-again
